<title>USA: NHP to buy back 750,000 shares.</title>
<headline>NHP to buy back 750,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>NHP Inc said on Tuesday that its board approved the repurchase of up to 750,000 shares, or six percent, of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company plans to finance the stock repurchases and its growth program, through a combination of its internally generated cash flow and its bank revolver.</p>
<p>In August 1995, NHP sold 4.3 million shares, 35 percent of its outstanding stock, in an initial public offering which was priced atf $13.00 a share.</p>
<p>NHP Inc provides nationwide real estate services.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
